  "description": "Whether escrow was used in a transaction.",
  "definition": "Values: Yes, No.\nLabel descriptions:\n- Yes: Funds were held in escrow pending delivery confirmation or dispute resolution, reducing counterparty risk.\n- No: Payment was released directly without escrow protection, increasing the chance of fraud."
}

{
